WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.280
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.550 --> 00:18.180
Everything is fated.

3
00:18.320 --> 00:19.650
Nothing is up to us.

4
00:21.830 --> 00:23.440
Half a life in officialdom,

5
00:23.510 --> 00:25.160
wielding power in my hands,

6
00:30.440 --> 00:32.560
I'm like a fish in this pond,

7
00:33.350 --> 00:35.640
coddled and fed by those around me.

8
00:42.000 --> 00:44.700
Yet even should the waters run dry,

9
00:45.320 --> 00:47.190
I shall never allow myself

10
00:47.320 --> 00:48.960
fall onto the chopping block

11
00:52.250 --> 00:53.640
to be slaughtered.

12
02:18.990 --> 02:23.860
[Light the Dark]

13
02:24.280 --> 02:26.750
[Episode 5]

14
02:50.430 --> 02:51.000
Come in.

15
02:53.400 --> 02:53.960
Boss.

16
03:01.190 --> 03:01.840
Boss,

17
03:01.910 --> 03:03.330
this is the list of

18
03:03.350 --> 03:04.720
all the remaining goods.

19
03:04.720 --> 03:05.780
Please take a look.

20
03:09.310 --> 03:10.660
Can't you see?

21
03:11.960 --> 03:13.790
It used to be crowded here,

22
03:14.360 --> 03:16.090
and there was a line at the door.

23
03:17.400 --> 03:19.360
We're not one player short anymore.

24
03:19.360 --> 03:20.970
We need three.

25
03:21.000 --> 03:22.400
Can't even play the game.

26
03:22.590 --> 03:23.310
Boss,

27
03:24.730 --> 03:26.329
the Red Dragon is still here.

28
03:26.410 --> 03:27.640
So, you're still the one

29
03:27.640 --> 03:28.850
sitting in the center

30
03:29.170 --> 03:30.970
and controlling the direction.

31
03:31.360 --> 03:33.290
Neither of us is the Red Dragon now.

32
03:34.640 --> 03:36.300
This batch of goods is.

33
03:35.370 --> 03:36.230
[List of goods]

34
03:36.600 --> 03:38.290
If we don't play it out quickly,

35
03:38.290 --> 03:39.750
and someone discovers it,

36
03:39.800 --> 03:41.410
everyone at this mahjong table

37
03:41.410 --> 03:42.920
will be doomed.

38
03:43.850 --> 03:45.600
Now everyone at the table

39
03:45.600 --> 03:46.520
is watching.

40
03:47.250 --> 03:48.120
I'm afraid

41
03:50.640 --> 03:52.300
it's not that easy to back out.

42
03:54.970 --> 03:56.900
You've been with me for many years,

43
03:56.920 --> 03:58.920
so you should understand one thing.

44
03:59.920 --> 04:01.730
Fortune favors the bold.

45
04:05.010 --> 04:07.340
This time, I won't take any of these tiles.

46
04:08.130 --> 04:09.190
They're all yours.

47
04:10.330 --> 04:11.100
Boss,

48
04:11.320 --> 04:12.650
that's not what I meant.

49
04:13.080 --> 04:14.040
These years, you've actually

50
04:14.040 --> 04:15.450
given me a lot.

51
04:15.730 --> 04:16.850
If it weren't for you,

52
04:16.850 --> 04:17.730
I'd just be

53
04:17.730 --> 04:19.040
an ordinary driver.

54
04:19.920 --> 04:21.560
I'm worried I might let you down

55
04:21.560 --> 04:22.770
and hold you back.

56
04:24.330 --> 04:25.120
But since

57
04:26.170 --> 04:27.630
you still trust me so much,

58
04:27.970 --> 04:28.770
then fine,

59
04:28.800 --> 04:30.400
we'll stick to the old rules.

60
04:30.850 --> 04:32.050
I'll take 30 percent.

61
04:33.960 --> 04:35.170
I knew I was right about you.

62
04:35.170 --> 04:36.100
You've got guts.

63
04:36.440 --> 04:38.440
This time, I'll give you 70 percent.

64
04:38.730 --> 04:39.920
Deal.

65
04:49.980 --> 04:50.860
How's it going?

66
04:52.640 --> 04:53.950
What do you think?

67
04:54.560 --> 04:55.250
Those old foxes

68
04:55.250 --> 04:56.210
under Wan Yang

69
04:56.290 --> 04:57.520
are really hard to deal with.

70
04:57.520 --> 04:59.650
Team Leader Pan and the investigators

71
04:59.800 --> 05:01.130
had several talks

72
05:01.180 --> 05:02.260
with them,

73
05:02.750 --> 05:05.290
but all of them were evasive and talking in circles.

74
05:05.290 --> 05:06.300
And without solid evidence,

75
05:06.300 --> 05:07.850
the investigation team

76
05:07.870 --> 05:09.200
had to release Wan Yang.

77
05:09.490 --> 05:10.820
They released Wan Yang?

78
05:12.520 --> 05:14.180
That secret warehouse Shan found

79
05:14.180 --> 05:15.940
while following Liu Jun

80
05:16.530 --> 05:18.370
should count as solid evidence, right?

81
05:18.370 --> 05:20.050
We can follow this lead

82
05:20.080 --> 05:20.830
and keep digging.

83
05:20.830 --> 05:22.690
I'm afraid this lead is a dead end.

84
05:22.760 --> 05:23.790
They must've found out

85
05:23.790 --> 05:25.160
the investigation team came.

86
05:25.160 --> 05:27.360
They probably transferred it long ago.

87
05:28.010 --> 05:28.570
Ying,

88
05:28.690 --> 05:29.300
you should first

89
05:29.300 --> 05:30.500
look for clues

90
05:30.530 --> 05:31.860
in those account books.

91
05:32.560 --> 05:33.330
Come here.

92
05:40.040 --> 05:42.970
These are the parts receipts for the past five years.

93
05:43.940 --> 05:44.740
I found that

94
05:45.770 --> 05:47.090
just the falsified scrap reports

95
05:47.090 --> 05:47.850
alone

96
05:48.120 --> 05:49.140
have cost our plant

97
05:49.140 --> 05:50.700
800,000 yuan in losses.

98
05:51.580 --> 05:52.780
800,000 yuan?

99
05:53.890 --> 05:54.730
How much does an ordinary family

100
05:54.730 --> 05:55.800
spend on food and clothing

101
05:55.800 --> 05:56.770
in a year?

102
05:56.920 --> 05:58.050
That's too corrupt!

103
05:58.550 --> 05:59.990
But these receipts

104
06:00.020 --> 06:01.680
aren't enough to be evidence.

105
06:01.720 --> 06:04.400
Based on my memory,

106
06:04.480 --> 06:05.670
I sorted out the years of the parts

107
06:05.670 --> 06:07.570
on the supply department's delivery notes.

108
06:07.570 --> 06:09.960
Then I compared them and found the problem.

109
06:09.960 --> 06:10.920
But on the surface,

110
06:10.920 --> 06:11.950
the account book

111
06:11.970 --> 06:13.490
is totally clean.

112
06:13.520 --> 06:14.390
The investigation team

113
06:14.390 --> 06:16.390
might not be able to audit anything.

114
06:17.430 --> 06:19.290
We must find the real account book

115
06:19.620 --> 06:21.180
to prove their crimes.

116
06:25.180 --> 06:27.040
You want to find the account book?

117
06:28.170 --> 06:28.970
They probably keep that thing

118
06:28.970 --> 06:30.480
on them even when they sleep.

119
06:30.480 --> 06:31.610
Where can we find it?

120
06:36.300 --> 06:37.230
Follow Wan Yang.

121
06:38.070 --> 06:39.730
We'll definitely find clues.

122
06:40.170 --> 06:40.970
As for you,

123
06:40.990 --> 06:42.159
stay at home.

124
06:42.180 --> 06:43.240
Don't go anywhere.

125
06:43.440 --> 06:44.530
-Ying -Be good.

126
06:51.480 --> 06:52.290
Shan.

127
06:52.290 --> 06:53.120
Got it.

128
07:13.310 --> 07:15.770
Take a look at the toys. Buy two, get one free.

129
07:23.470 --> 07:25.670
Liu Hong just went in.

130
07:30.560 --> 07:32.980
Look, for this shipment,

131
07:34.970 --> 07:36.340
can you let Sun Jie

132
07:36.360 --> 07:37.800
take Jun with him?

133
07:38.090 --> 07:39.120
Sun Jie was trained

134
07:39.120 --> 07:40.210
by you.

135
07:40.890 --> 07:41.650
If Jun

136
07:41.650 --> 07:42.680
works with him,

137
07:42.680 --> 07:44.650
he can also learn some of your skills.

138
07:44.650 --> 07:46.310
You can ask for anything else.

139
07:46.650 --> 07:48.650
Don't you know how dangerous

140
07:48.650 --> 07:49.650
this shipment is?

141
07:50.170 --> 07:50.970
Sun...

142
07:58.090 --> 07:59.620
Even Sun Jie chickened out.

143
07:59.970 --> 08:01.880
I promised him 70 percent, and that's why

144
08:01.880 --> 08:03.480
he dared to take the mission.

145
08:04.250 --> 08:05.060
70 percent?

146
08:05.100 --> 08:05.770
Don't yell.

147
08:06.160 --> 08:07.480
Yes, we didn't get Jun

148
08:07.480 --> 08:08.800
involved in many things.

149
08:08.800 --> 08:09.680
But you've given him

150
08:09.680 --> 08:11.210
too little.

151
08:11.410 --> 08:13.340
You're giving an outsider so much.

152
08:13.440 --> 08:14.540
This outsider can risk his life for me.

153
08:14.540 --> 08:15.310
Can Jun do it?

154
08:15.560 --> 08:17.170
He's a useless man,

155
08:17.440 --> 08:20.100
and you're protecting him like he's a treasure.

156
08:20.600 --> 08:22.170
You think I don't know?

157
08:22.850 --> 08:23.560
Haven't you given him

158
08:23.560 --> 08:24.820
money from our family?

159
08:25.890 --> 08:27.210
Besides, the money he's made in the plant

160
08:27.210 --> 08:28.240
over the past few years

161
08:28.240 --> 08:29.770
is enough for him to live on.

162
08:30.170 --> 08:31.170
Believe it or not,

163
08:31.330 --> 08:32.409
if you give him 30,000 yuan today,

164
08:32.409 --> 08:33.610
he'll drive a Santana

165
08:33.610 --> 08:34.770
to the plant gate tomorrow

166
08:34.770 --> 08:35.559
to show off.

167
08:37.250 --> 08:39.010
What's wrong with giving him money?

168
08:39.010 --> 08:40.039
He's my brother.

169
08:40.039 --> 08:40.490
Giving it to him

170
08:40.490 --> 08:42.169
is better than giving it to an outsider!

171
08:42.169 --> 08:42.960
Wan Yang,

172
08:43.610 --> 08:45.010
don't play dumb.

173
08:46.440 --> 08:47.610
Have you ever cared about our family?

174
08:47.610 --> 08:49.250
Whenever you open your mouth,

175
08:49.250 --> 08:50.800
everyone has to do as you say.

176
08:50.800 --> 08:51.660
What about Jun?

177
08:51.920 --> 08:53.770
He's been helping out without any complaints.

178
08:53.770 --> 08:54.560
He truly respects you

179
08:54.560 --> 08:55.610
as his brother-in-law!

180
08:55.610 --> 08:56.320
What about you?

181
08:56.320 --> 08:57.180
What about you?

182
08:57.320 --> 08:58.080
I always thought

183
08:58.080 --> 08:59.340
you were a smart person

184
08:59.370 --> 09:00.490
who could see the bigger picture.

185
09:00.490 --> 09:01.040
How could you be so disgraceful

186
09:01.040 --> 09:02.370
at a crucial moment like this?

187
09:02.370 --> 09:04.100
You're just like your brother!

188
09:10.250 --> 09:11.040
Wan Yang,

189
09:15.130 --> 09:16.930
we've been married for decades,

190
09:18.740 --> 09:20.390
and this is how you see me?

191
09:34.010 --> 09:35.540
Take a look at the fine wine.

192
10:19.010 --> 10:20.250
Jie, be quick.

193
10:20.370 --> 10:21.900
We've been waiting for you.

194
10:22.490 --> 10:23.680
You do this all the time.

195
10:23.680 --> 10:25.010
We'll play first.

196
10:27.460 --> 10:27.910
Help yourself.

197
10:27.910 --> 10:28.290
Okay.

198
10:29.000 --> 10:30.290
Okay, ship the goods.

199
10:32.400 --> 10:33.850
Mr. Lin, the goods have been shipped.

200
10:33.850 --> 10:34.420
Look,

201
10:34.450 --> 10:35.770
go to the arranged warehouse

202
10:35.770 --> 10:37.760
and wait to receive them.

203
10:37.780 --> 10:39.170
Okay. Thank you, Department Chief Sun,

204
10:39.170 --> 10:40.400
for giving me such a good price.

205
10:40.400 --> 10:41.460
Well, the money...

206
10:41.530 --> 10:42.500
As usual.

207
10:42.530 --> 10:43.930
Give it to Hong's people.

208
10:44.080 --> 10:45.250
Okay, no problem.

209
10:45.250 --> 10:45.960
Glad to work with you.

210
10:45.960 --> 10:47.160
-Okay. -I'm leaving.

211
10:47.660 --> 10:48.300
Okay.

212
10:52.600 --> 10:54.530
We must find the real account book

213
10:54.550 --> 10:56.070
to prove their crimes.

214
11:02.360 --> 11:06.350
[Imperial Virtue and Divine Might]

215
11:03.530 --> 11:05.010
Sister, how is it?

216
11:06.610 --> 11:08.270
Did my brother-in-law agree?

217
11:08.800 --> 11:10.150
He agreed.

218
11:10.180 --> 11:11.850
Now, go to the hotpot restaurant

219
11:11.850 --> 11:13.110
and do as I say.

220
11:27.220 --> 11:28.130
Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant.

221
11:28.130 --> 11:28.770
Okay.

222
11:38.230 --> 11:38.660
Hurry.

223
11:38.690 --> 11:40.460
Sir, follow that motorcycle.

224
11:38.860 --> 11:44.100
[Wugang Taxi]

225
11:40.490 --> 11:40.970
Okay.

226
11:45.830 --> 11:47.250
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

227
11:58.400 --> 11:59.010
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

228
11:59.220 --> 12:01.580
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

229
11:59.420 --> 12:01.530
Hong, why are you here?

230
12:02.080 --> 12:02.720
The money will be delivered to you

231
12:02.720 --> 12:03.920
in a moment.

232
12:04.890 --> 12:05.800
I'm just here

233
12:06.190 --> 12:07.590
to tell you

234
12:07.960 --> 12:09.440
to get the amount right

235
12:09.470 --> 12:11.070
when calculating the money.

236
12:11.390 --> 12:12.520
It's not 70 percent.

237
12:13.360 --> 12:14.290
It's 30 percent.

238
12:16.060 --> 12:17.720
Director Wan and I

239
12:17.750 --> 12:18.950
agreed on 70 percent.

240
12:19.490 --> 12:21.100
Sun Jie,

241
12:21.690 --> 12:23.080
your appetite has really grown

242
12:23.080 --> 12:25.950
over the years.

243
12:26.440 --> 12:27.410
Are you forcing me

244
12:27.410 --> 12:29.040
to say this?

245
12:29.040 --> 12:29.800
Without Wan's help,

246
12:29.800 --> 12:31.530
could you have made it this far?

247
12:31.730 --> 12:34.230
Don't crave what you shouldn't have.

248
12:34.260 --> 12:35.890
Is this your idea

249
12:37.010 --> 12:38.420
or Director Wan's idea?

250
12:40.710 --> 12:41.660
Questioning me?

251
12:42.200 --> 12:42.960
Oh my god.

252
12:42.980 --> 12:44.780
You even dare to question me now?

253
12:45.030 --> 12:46.410
Sun Jie,

254
12:47.320 --> 12:48.250
you used to be

255
12:48.250 --> 12:49.840
merely Wan's driver.

256
12:50.060 --> 12:51.020
Without our family,

257
12:51.020 --> 12:52.250
you wouldn't even be able to touch

258
12:52.250 --> 12:52.720
the tires of a Santana!

259
12:52.720 --> 12:53.650
Are you out of your mind?

260
12:53.650 --> 12:54.910
What's wrong with you?

261
12:56.680 --> 12:57.560
I'm sorry.

262
12:58.300 --> 12:59.970
Sorry, Hong. I shouldn't have said that.

263
12:59.970 --> 13:01.050
I crossed the line.

264
13:01.080 --> 13:02.000
I'm so sorry.

265
13:02.040 --> 13:02.550
I'm sorry.

266
13:02.550 --> 13:04.310
I'll walk you out, Hong.

267
13:05.300 --> 13:06.280
70 percent.

268
13:06.680 --> 13:07.720
Not a penny less.

269
13:07.720 --> 13:09.380
Don't worry, not a penny less.

270
13:14.800 --> 13:16.280
Then I'll stop here, Hong.

271
13:19.090 --> 13:20.850
Take care, Hong.

272
13:35.360 --> 13:35.930
Mr. Lin,

273
13:36.650 --> 13:38.410
the guy collecting money for Hong

274
13:38.410 --> 13:39.290
is in trouble.

275
13:39.310 --> 13:40.370
He's been noticed.

276
13:40.420 --> 13:41.820
Don't give him the money.

277
13:41.850 --> 13:42.610
A guy called Shui

278
13:42.610 --> 13:43.900
replaced him.

279
13:44.290 --> 13:45.100
Give it to him.

280
13:45.120 --> 13:45.720
I'll send you his number

281
13:45.720 --> 13:46.890
in a bit, okay?

282
13:47.320 --> 13:47.840
Okay.

283
14:12.770 --> 14:14.140
Slow down, sir.

284
14:14.210 --> 14:15.210
No need to follow too closely.

285
14:15.210 --> 14:15.760
Okay.

286
14:21.300 --> 14:22.030
Hello, Shui.

287
14:22.040 --> 14:23.020
Did you get the money?

288
14:23.020 --> 14:23.960
Yes.

289
14:24.300 --> 14:26.270
Okay, bring it to Pier 5 right away

290
14:26.290 --> 14:27.440
and wait for me there.

291
14:27.440 --> 14:28.190
Okay.

292
14:30.690 --> 14:31.350
Right here.

293
14:32.780 --> 14:33.390
Okay.

294
14:37.310 --> 14:38.470
Here, thanks.

295
14:41.150 --> 14:42.740
[Renovating, Closed]

296
14:49.370 --> 14:52.770
[Renovating, Closed]

297
14:54.390 --> 14:55.980
Jun, why are you here?

298
14:56.010 --> 14:56.720
Are you closed?

299
14:56.720 --> 14:58.260
Hong said we needed to renovate.

300
14:58.260 --> 14:59.060
That's right.

301
14:59.510 --> 15:00.560
My sister

302
15:00.840 --> 15:02.400
will come over to eat later.

303
15:02.520 --> 15:03.880
Get some food.

304
15:02.890 --> 15:05.750
[Renovating, Closed]

305
15:04.550 --> 15:05.710
Hong didn't tell me.

306
15:05.910 --> 15:07.420
She told me.

307
15:08.490 --> 15:09.170
Okay.

308
15:09.170 --> 15:09.440
Go, hurry.

309
15:09.440 --> 15:10.170
Okay.

310
15:15.830 --> 15:19.310
[Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant]

311
15:50.040 --> 15:51.010
Did they move the plant

312
15:51.010 --> 15:52.540
to their home?

313
15:57.000 --> 15:58.040
Not bad.

314
16:30.110 --> 16:31.110
Here's the money.

315
16:33.140 --> 16:34.870
The ship is already at the pier.

316
16:35.570 --> 16:36.660
Drive the car away.

317
16:37.210 --> 16:37.780
Okay.

318
17:05.200 --> 17:06.050
Who are you?

319
17:06.329 --> 17:07.440
Who are you?

320
17:07.480 --> 17:08.480
I'm Liu Jun.

321
17:09.130 --> 17:10.329
Liu Hong is my sister.

322
17:10.369 --> 17:11.569
My sister told me

323
17:11.589 --> 17:13.380
that I'll be in charge of transportation from now on.

324
17:13.380 --> 17:14.180
Wait a minute.

325
17:14.609 --> 17:15.960
I'll tell my boss.

326
17:21.609 --> 17:22.760
I'll stay here.

327
17:22.880 --> 17:23.950
Go back now

328
17:24.109 --> 17:24.960
and report this

329
17:24.960 --> 17:26.490
to the investigation team.

330
17:26.849 --> 17:27.440
Hurry!

331
17:27.440 --> 17:28.200
Don't let him escape.

332
17:28.200 --> 17:29.200
Be careful.

333
17:38.290 --> 17:39.710
[Incoming Call] [Answer]

334
17:41.440 --> 17:42.170
Hello?

335
17:42.220 --> 17:42.960
Director,

336
17:43.200 --> 17:44.800
I have something to tell you.

337
17:44.810 --> 17:45.810
Go ahead.

338
17:46.410 --> 17:48.170
Liu Jun went to Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant.

339
17:48.170 --> 17:49.090
He said Hong asked him

340
17:49.090 --> 17:50.200
to take over the transportation.

341
17:50.200 --> 17:51.050
Did you know?

342
17:52.170 --> 17:53.070
Where is he?

343
17:53.090 --> 17:54.290
He's left.

344
18:50.060 --> 18:50.960
Back off!

345
19:50.730 --> 19:51.530
Don't grab it!

346
19:51.830 --> 19:52.630
Put it down!

347
20:08.960 --> 20:10.070
[No Swimming. It's Dangerous. Ignore It at Your Own Risk.]

348
20:33.890 --> 20:34.720
Let go!

349
20:36.000 --> 20:36.810
Let go!

350
21:00.080 --> 21:02.920
[Pier 5]

351
21:04.890 --> 21:05.890
Go!

352
21:06.240 --> 21:07.110
Go! Hurry!

353
21:58.230 --> 22:00.280
Director, something terrible happened.

354
22:00.280 --> 22:02.240
Chen Shan snatched the account book.

355
22:02.240 --> 22:03.440
All our financial transactions

356
22:03.440 --> 22:04.480
are written in it.

357
22:04.660 --> 22:05.590
It'll definitely

358
22:05.590 --> 22:06.980
fall into the hands of the investigation team.

359
22:06.980 --> 22:08.440
There's no turning back.

360
22:08.460 --> 22:10.060
Director, what should we do?

361
22:25.100 --> 22:26.150
This is the address.

362
22:26.150 --> 22:27.750
Qi Mo is keeping an eye on him.

363
22:27.840 --> 22:29.240
Okay. Wang,

364
22:29.260 --> 22:30.240
take this.

365
22:30.260 --> 22:32.110
Take your people to this address immediately.

366
22:32.110 --> 22:33.420
Make sure to protect the evidence.

367
22:33.420 --> 22:34.070
Yes, sir.

368
22:34.150 --> 22:34.940
Zhang,

369
22:35.080 --> 22:36.160
tell the police

370
22:36.180 --> 22:37.340
to cooperate

371
22:37.360 --> 22:38.500
and ensure everyone's safety.

372
22:38.500 --> 22:39.150
Yes, sir!

373
22:41.610 --> 22:42.430
Team Leader Pan.

374
22:42.430 --> 22:43.900
My brother said Sun Jie escaped.

375
22:43.900 --> 22:45.040
What about Wan Yang?

376
22:45.920 --> 22:46.980
Go to the teahouse.

377
22:47.440 --> 22:48.770
Department Chief Wang.

378
22:49.410 --> 22:50.200
Department Chief Wang.

379
22:50.200 --> 22:50.850
Who is it?

380
22:50.850 --> 22:51.760
Take your men

381
22:51.760 --> 22:52.760
