382
22:53.090 --> 22:54.020
Team Leader Pan.

383
22:54.040 --> 22:55.020
Hurry! Go!

384
22:55.130 --> 22:56.410
Go! Follow him!

385
22:56.410 --> 22:57.310
Hurry up!

386
23:10.020 --> 23:10.710
Ying.

387
23:11.170 --> 23:11.960
Shan.

388
23:13.410 --> 23:14.370
You're all here.

389
23:19.680 --> 23:20.480
Ying.

390
23:21.900 --> 23:24.010
You were smart as a kid.

391
23:24.370 --> 23:26.050
I watched you grow up.

392
23:27.790 --> 23:30.690
And now you're even more clever.

393
23:32.640 --> 23:34.200
Do you think you've investigated

394
23:34.200 --> 23:35.760
everything clearly?

395
23:41.540 --> 23:42.260
Shan.

396
23:43.200 --> 23:44.920
Take good care of your sister.

397
23:50.980 --> 23:51.940
Zhang Wenying,

398
23:53.000 --> 23:53.850
Chen Fu,

399
23:55.670 --> 23:57.920
you're luckier than me.

400
25:04.530 --> 25:05.160
Everyone,

401
25:05.780 --> 25:08.080
entrusted by the superiors and the plant party committee,

402
25:06.270 --> 25:10.900
[Boost Efficiency Through Reform, Thrive Through Technology]

403
25:08.180 --> 25:09.780
I'm making an announcement.

404
25:10.240 --> 25:12.050
The investigation team

405
25:11.020 --> 25:16.610
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Mobilization Meeting]

406
25:12.050 --> 25:13.280
thoroughly investigated

407
25:13.280 --> 25:14.850
the Project 713 accident

408
25:14.870 --> 25:16.830
and a series of disciplinary

409
25:17.050 --> 25:18.960
and legal violations

410
25:19.080 --> 25:20.790
[Wang Hao] [Zhang Xiangyang]

411
25:19.130 --> 25:20.460
uncovered at the plant.

412
25:20.890 --> 25:22.810
The investigation findings

413
25:20.940 --> 25:25.510
[Wang Hao] [Pan Minghui] [Zhang Xiangyang]

414
25:22.810 --> 25:24.170
and the decisions on the actions

415
25:24.170 --> 25:25.850
are hereby announced as follows.

416
25:25.850 --> 25:27.380
First, it has been verified

417
25:27.570 --> 25:28.810
that Wan Yang, the former plant manager,

418
25:28.810 --> 25:31.110
embezzled state assets and accepted bribes

419
25:31.110 --> 25:32.780
during his tenure overseeing

420
25:32.800 --> 25:34.620
the construction and daily operations

421
25:34.620 --> 25:35.720
of Project 713.

422
25:35.500 --> 25:37.430
[Pan Minghui]

423
25:35.850 --> 25:36.850
The violations are serious

424
25:36.850 --> 25:37.720
and egregious in nature.

425
25:37.540 --> 25:39.900
[Wang Hao] [Zhang Xiangyang]

426
25:37.740 --> 25:40.050
Sun Jie, the former supply department chief,

427
25:40.050 --> 25:41.770
Liu Hong, wife of Wan Yang,

428
25:41.790 --> 25:43.540
her relative Liu Jun, and others

429
25:43.540 --> 25:45.000
also participated in the crimes

430
25:45.000 --> 25:46.130
to varying degrees.

431
25:46.130 --> 25:48.330
Most of the illicit funds have been recovered,

432
25:48.330 --> 25:51.260
and relevant witness testimonies, evidence, and documents

433
25:51.260 --> 25:53.140
have all been verified and secured.

434
25:53.140 --> 25:54.870
Second, given the above facts,

435
25:54.890 --> 25:56.720
the relevant personnel are handled as follows.

436
25:56.720 --> 25:57.780
Wan Yang, the principal offender,

437
25:57.780 --> 25:59.490
committed suicide out of fear of punishment during the investigation.

438
25:59.490 --> 26:02.130
With the approval of superiors, he is expelled from the Party

439
26:02.130 --> 26:02.960
and the plant.

440
26:03.000 --> 26:05.480
All posthumous benefits are canceled.

441
26:05.800 --> 26:07.120
Accomplices Sun Jie,

442
26:07.140 --> 26:08.740
Liu Hong, Liu Jun, and others

443
26:08.940 --> 26:11.070
have been handed over to the judicial authorities

444
26:11.070 --> 26:12.520
for severe punishment according to the law.

445
26:12.520 --> 26:14.810
He Jianchuan, the former construction team leader,

446
26:14.810 --> 26:17.340
and Feng Jian, the design department deputy director,

447
26:17.340 --> 26:20.050
abused their power and failed to report what they knew.

448
26:20.050 --> 26:22.300
They are transferred and demoted.

449
26:22.650 --> 26:24.310
After careful investigation

450
26:24.330 --> 26:25.850
and prudent consideration,

451
26:25.850 --> 26:28.130
we've decided that because Chen Fu died in the line of duty,

452
26:28.130 --> 26:29.920
a pension of 100,000 yuan

453
26:30.920 --> 26:33.320
will be given to his family on a chosen date.

454
26:33.330 --> 26:34.530
As for Zhang Wenying,

455
26:34.720 --> 26:37.130
as the former director of the design department,

456
26:37.130 --> 26:39.890
she failed to report and covered up

457
26:39.920 --> 26:42.130
multiple cases involving Wan Yang.

458
26:42.240 --> 26:44.680
All her lifetime ranks and honorary titles

459
26:44.680 --> 26:45.890
are now revoked.

460
26:46.520 --> 26:48.330
In addition, according to reports from the people,

461
26:48.330 --> 26:51.000
her daughter Chen Ying's accounting job

462
26:51.240 --> 26:52.640
in the supply department

463
26:52.850 --> 26:53.850
was also due to

464
26:53.850 --> 26:55.680
her connections.

465
26:56.090 --> 26:58.340
She is hereby dismissed.

466
27:00.530 --> 27:01.170
Wait.

467
27:02.690 --> 27:03.290
Everyone,

468
27:03.290 --> 27:05.160
this is a hard lesson.

469
27:05.190 --> 27:06.900
All cadres and workers

470
27:06.930 --> 27:08.150
must take this as a warning

471
27:08.150 --> 27:09.090
and strictly abide by

472
27:09.090 --> 27:12.110
-the national laws and regulations. -They're corrupt.

473
27:12.110 --> 27:13.290
They deserved this.

474
27:14.770 --> 27:18.110
Now, the market-oriented reform of the plant

475
27:18.140 --> 27:19.400
is imminent.

476
27:20.240 --> 27:21.920
At this critical point,

477
27:22.170 --> 27:24.050
we need to select a new plant director

478
27:24.050 --> 27:25.940
as soon as possible.

479
27:27.360 --> 27:28.120
Ying.

480
27:29.130 --> 27:29.920
Ying.

481
27:33.410 --> 27:34.200
Well...

482
27:34.890 --> 27:35.680
Ying.

483
27:36.480 --> 27:39.020
Don't worry.

484
27:39.040 --> 27:40.720
I'll explain it to

485
27:40.750 --> 27:42.080
the investigation team

486
27:42.170 --> 27:43.570
and try to persuade them.

487
27:44.980 --> 27:46.180
Thank you, Mr. Qi.

488
27:47.500 --> 27:50.100
The bad guys got the punishment they deserved.

489
27:51.230 --> 27:52.350
In our opinion,

490
27:53.370 --> 27:55.290
getting justice for our parents

491
27:55.440 --> 27:57.040
is the most important thing.

492
27:57.720 --> 27:59.520
Other things don't matter to me.

493
28:00.100 --> 28:01.560
Hurry back to the meeting.

494
28:01.730 --> 28:02.750
We're going home.

495
28:12.100 --> 28:13.090
Hello, everyone.

496
28:13.090 --> 28:15.420
I'm Geng Jian, the acting plant director.

497
28:15.960 --> 28:18.610
You're working hundreds of miles away.

498
28:18.640 --> 28:20.470
And I'm always concerned about you.

499
28:20.470 --> 28:22.540
Make sure to be safe

500
28:23.660 --> 28:25.260
and take care of yourselves.

501
28:25.520 --> 28:27.090
Once I'm done with work,

502
28:27.090 --> 28:28.370
I'll go see you.

503
28:28.720 --> 28:29.640
Okay. Goodbye.

504
28:35.240 --> 28:35.760
Come in.

505
28:37.050 --> 28:37.790
What's the matter?

506
28:37.790 --> 28:38.920
-Are you busy? -Yes.

507
28:40.870 --> 28:42.820
Well, I want to talk to you.

508
28:43.000 --> 28:43.810
Well,

509
28:44.150 --> 28:46.210
now that Wan Yang and Sun Jie are gone,

510
28:46.610 --> 28:49.410
there is no one in charge of the supply department.

511
28:49.480 --> 28:50.170
So, what should

512
28:50.170 --> 28:51.900
the supply department do next?

513
28:51.960 --> 28:54.130
You're the top leader and the plant director.

514
28:54.130 --> 28:55.790
Please give us some guidance.

515
28:56.280 --> 28:57.760
The new plant director

516
28:57.760 --> 28:58.890
hasn't been decided yet.

517
28:58.890 --> 29:00.550
I'm just the acting director.

518
29:00.630 --> 29:01.800
Well, about that...

519
29:01.820 --> 29:03.370
Don't be so modest.

520
29:03.830 --> 29:06.000
Didn't you hear what the leader said at the meeting?

521
29:06.000 --> 29:09.390
He said we need to select a new director as soon as possible

522
29:09.410 --> 29:11.090
to lead the reform work.

523
29:11.720 --> 29:12.760
He also said

524
29:12.760 --> 29:14.890
the new director must have experience

525
29:14.960 --> 29:17.260
and understand the business and technology.

526
29:17.260 --> 29:19.300
Who else could it be but you?

527
29:20.130 --> 29:22.060
By the way, there's one more thing.

528
29:23.370 --> 29:24.370
A few days ago,

529
29:24.480 --> 29:25.810
someone gave my wife

530
29:26.090 --> 29:27.240
a painting,

531
29:27.720 --> 29:29.240
saying it was by

532
29:29.240 --> 29:30.650
that famous painter

533
29:30.680 --> 29:31.720
named Zhao Hui.

534
29:31.040 --> 29:32.720
[Gathering of Fine Traits]

535
29:32.000 --> 29:32.810
Take a look.

536
29:33.170 --> 29:34.920
Chrysanthemum, orchid, plum blossom, and bamboo.

537
29:34.920 --> 29:35.850
My wife said

538
29:35.920 --> 29:38.590
it's a refined piece of art.

539
29:39.480 --> 29:40.370
Then I thought

540
29:40.610 --> 29:42.330
a refined work like this

541
29:42.920 --> 29:46.280
should belong to a capable person.

542
29:47.520 --> 29:48.240
Then it occurred to me

543
29:48.240 --> 29:50.100
the most capable person around me

544
29:50.470 --> 29:51.740
is you, right?

545
29:53.760 --> 29:55.590
So, I quickly packed it up.

546
29:55.710 --> 29:57.730
I'll leave it here.

547
29:57.870 --> 29:58.920
Right here.

548
30:01.610 --> 30:02.720
Department Chief Gao, what are you doing?

549
30:02.720 --> 30:03.720
I-I'm not doing anything.

550
30:03.720 --> 30:04.480
What are you doing?

551
30:04.480 --> 30:04.850
I...

552
30:04.850 --> 30:05.810
Wan Yang just fell.

553
30:05.810 --> 30:06.480
Do you want me

554
30:06.480 --> 30:07.480
to repeat his tragedy?

555
30:07.480 --> 30:08.170
I-I didn't...

556
30:08.170 --> 30:08.410
Take it back.

557
30:08.410 --> 30:09.040
That's not what I meant.

558
30:09.040 --> 30:09.440
Take it back.

559
30:09.440 --> 30:10.170
That's not what I meant!

560
30:10.170 --> 30:10.610
Take it back!

561
30:10.610 --> 30:10.920
Director,

562
30:10.920 --> 30:12.330
please put it down. Put it down.

563
30:12.330 --> 30:13.280
Listen to me.

564
30:13.280 --> 30:14.090
I...

565
30:14.200 --> 30:15.000
I...

566
30:15.610 --> 30:16.520
I'm not good with words.

567
30:16.520 --> 30:17.850
I mean, I'm gifting

568
30:18.680 --> 30:20.760
this painting

569
30:21.050 --> 30:22.960
to the plant.

570
30:23.180 --> 30:24.330
I'm giving it to the plant.

571
30:24.330 --> 30:25.760
It belongs to the plant now.

572
30:25.760 --> 30:27.240
You're the top leader and the director.

573
30:27.240 --> 30:28.330
So, you can decide

574
30:28.520 --> 30:30.650
how to use the plant's resources,

575
30:31.090 --> 30:31.920
right?

576
30:32.960 --> 30:33.760
I think

577
30:34.000 --> 30:35.520
in a week at most...

578
30:35.760 --> 30:36.760
In a week,

579
30:36.760 --> 30:39.200
the appointment will definitely be issued.

580
30:39.200 --> 30:40.240
Well, I...

581
30:40.240 --> 30:41.130
on behalf of the supply department,

582
30:41.130 --> 30:42.610
I swear...

583
30:42.920 --> 30:44.960
Oh, no, I'm making a statement.

584
30:46.090 --> 30:47.650
Everyone in the supply department

585
30:47.650 --> 30:49.380
is ready for the reform.

586
30:49.400 --> 30:51.800
We're just waiting for your order.

587
30:55.480 --> 30:57.740
We'll deal with that when the time comes.

588
31:00.610 --> 31:01.520
But

589
31:01.680 --> 31:03.130
our work can't be delayed.

590
31:03.130 --> 31:03.920
That's right.

591
31:03.920 --> 31:05.280
Department Chief Gao,

592
31:05.280 --> 31:07.280
now that you've started preparing,

593
31:07.720 --> 31:08.810
you should take charge of the department

594
31:08.810 --> 31:10.370
for now.

595
31:10.370 --> 31:11.520
Wait, I...

596
31:11.610 --> 31:12.280
Also,

597
31:12.280 --> 31:13.610
we can't let

598
31:14.000 --> 31:15.130
people like

599
31:15.330 --> 31:17.130
Wan Yang and Sun Jie

600
31:17.130 --> 31:17.920
disrupt our progress

601
31:17.920 --> 31:19.090
in the reform.

602
31:19.890 --> 31:20.810
Don't worry.

603
31:20.830 --> 31:22.960
I'll definitely fulfill the mission.

604
31:23.240 --> 31:24.200
I'll leave you to it.

605
31:24.200 --> 31:25.090
I'm leaving.

606
31:56.880 --> 32:05.550
[September 3]

607
32:18.030 --> 32:18.620
Ying,

608
32:18.950 --> 32:20.520
why don't you wait a bit longer?

609
32:20.520 --> 32:21.200
I've been

610
32:21.200 --> 32:22.570
looking for information these days.

611
32:22.570 --> 32:24.450
Let's go to the plant and fight for it.

612
32:24.450 --> 32:25.200
If it really doesn't work,

613
32:25.200 --> 32:26.930
we'll look for a job elsewhere.

614
32:27.480 --> 32:29.090
Didn't you always say

615
32:29.090 --> 32:30.090
that we can't stay

616
32:30.090 --> 32:32.130
in our parents' plant forever,

617
32:32.410 --> 32:34.520
and that we have to go out and see the world?

618
32:34.520 --> 32:35.670
Things have changed.

619
32:35.670 --> 32:37.200
The plant doesn't want me,

620
32:37.810 --> 32:39.240
so I have to look forward.

621
32:40.410 --> 32:41.720
I've thought it through.

622
32:41.720 --> 32:42.650
Once I find a job,

623
32:42.410 --> 32:45.510
[Reform and Opening Up Need Talent; Enterprise Growth Depends on Talent]

624
32:42.650 --> 32:44.510
I can definitely support myself.

625
32:44.520 --> 32:46.050
As for Guangzhou,

626
32:46.090 --> 32:47.620
you should go if you have to.

627
32:48.130 --> 32:49.410
But listen,

628
32:50.090 --> 32:51.480
if you gain a foothold there,

629
32:51.480 --> 32:54.280
you must come back and take me there with you, okay?

630
32:56.280 --> 32:56.920
Look,

631
32:57.240 --> 32:58.280
with my resume,

632
32:58.650 --> 33:01.050
finding a job will be a piece of cake, right?

633
33:04.090 --> 33:05.200
Okay, go back and wait for our reply.

634
33:05.200 --> 33:06.800
There are fewer people here.

635
33:09.170 --> 33:09.960
Hello.

636
33:10.570 --> 33:12.760
I'm looking for an accounting job.

637
33:14.440 --> 33:15.520
Chen Ying. Accounting job...

638
33:15.520 --> 33:16.200
Yes.

639
33:16.200 --> 33:17.530
Wugang Petrochemical?

640
33:19.090 --> 33:21.090
Chen Fu and Zhang Wenying...

641
33:21.090 --> 33:23.220
Are they the ones in the newspaper?

642
33:23.320 --> 33:25.610
Yes. Why is she here?

643
33:28.000 --> 33:29.660
Is Zhang Wenying your mother?

644
33:29.740 --> 33:31.800
She covered up the director's crime.

645
33:31.810 --> 33:33.170
So, your family is involved

646
33:33.170 --> 33:34.500
in the recent scandal of

647
33:34.760 --> 33:36.610
Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant?

648
33:36.610 --> 33:37.440
Your mother covered up

649
33:37.440 --> 33:38.700
the director's crime?

650
33:39.110 --> 33:41.970
-Why talking about her mother? -Alright. Let’s go.

651
33:43.890 --> 33:45.590
It's okay. Let's talk to someone else.

652
33:45.590 --> 33:46.920
Just ignore them, Ying.

653
33:48.960 --> 33:50.000
Wait a moment.

654
33:50.000 --> 33:50.740
I need to take a call.

655
33:50.740 --> 33:51.330
Go ahead.

656
33:53.480 --> 33:54.010
Hello.

657
33:56.680 --> 33:57.280
Hello.

658
33:57.480 --> 33:59.130
I'm the HR manager

659
33:59.130 --> 34:00.760
of Guangdong Petrochemical Plant.

660
34:00.760 --> 34:02.610
Is this Mr. Chen Shan?

661
34:03.350 --> 34:05.070
Yes, this is Chen Shan.

662
34:05.280 --> 34:06.280
Hello, Chen Shan.

663
34:06.410 --> 34:07.170
A month ago,

664
34:07.170 --> 34:08.400
you turned down the engineer position

665
34:08.400 --> 34:10.060
in our technical department.

666
34:10.360 --> 34:11.840
It was really a pity.

667
34:12.090 --> 34:13.679
But now we have a new position

668
34:13.679 --> 34:15.199
in the engineering department.

669
34:15.199 --> 34:15.929
After review,

670
34:15.929 --> 34:17.530
you're still very suitable.

671
34:17.530 --> 34:19.199
I wonder if you'd consider

672
34:19.199 --> 34:21.270
taking the position.

673
34:22.360 --> 34:23.170
I'm sorry.

674
34:23.810 --> 34:25.449
I wonder if you

675
34:26.010 --> 34:27.670
still have any

676
34:27.870 --> 34:29.989
accounting vacancies right now.

677
34:31.560 --> 34:33.170
No, not at the moment.

678
34:34.210 --> 34:35.020
No?

679
34:35.050 --> 34:35.900
That's right.

680
34:38.010 --> 34:39.610
Alright then, I won't

681
34:39.610 --> 34:41.159
take that position.

682
34:41.190 --> 34:41.880
Thank you.

683
34:41.969 --> 34:42.719
Actually,

684
34:42.719 --> 34:44.449
I only want to find a job.

685
34:44.800 --> 34:46.570
How about this? Take a copy of my resume.

686
34:46.570 --> 34:47.800
My phone number is on it.

687
34:47.800 --> 34:49.489
If there are any suitable jobs,

688
34:49.489 --> 34:50.969
please call me, okay?

689
34:50.989 --> 34:51.550
Okay.

690
34:51.580 --> 34:52.330
Thanks.

691
34:56.489 --> 34:57.420
Team Leader Pan.

692
34:58.720 --> 35:00.050
You were looking for me?

693
35:00.570 --> 35:01.280
Mr. Qi.

694
35:01.490 --> 35:02.170
We received

695
35:02.170 --> 35:03.760
your reform proposal.

696
35:04.170 --> 35:06.930
Many of your ideas are very interesting.

697
35:06.950 --> 35:08.120
Conflicts and disagreements

698
35:08.120 --> 35:10.720
are inevitable during the reform of a company.

699
35:11.680 --> 35:12.810
What's your opinion

700
35:12.990 --> 35:13.870
on that?

701
35:14.010 --> 35:15.530
Right now, our plant is like

702
35:15.530 --> 35:17.440
an old ship stranded in the tide of reform.

703
35:17.440 --> 35:18.460
If we don't transform,

704
35:18.460 --> 35:19.810
we will only sink.

705
35:19.980 --> 35:22.540
Personnel integration and position streamlining

706
35:22.540 --> 35:24.460
will definitely be a hard process.

707
35:24.460 --> 35:25.330
But this is also

708
35:25.650 --> 35:27.760
the necessary path to break through the dilemma.

709
35:27.760 --> 35:30.070
To completely fix the long-rooted problems and turn the tables,

710
35:30.070 --> 35:32.530
we must boldly break out of our old patterns.

711
35:33.460 --> 35:34.130
Great.

712
35:35.330 --> 35:36.510
Mr. Qi, thank you so much

713
35:36.510 --> 35:38.370
for practical ideas and honesty.

714
35:38.680 --> 35:39.990
I've already submitted

715
35:39.990 --> 35:41.650
your proposal to the leaders.

716
35:42.440 --> 35:43.390
Thank you.

717
35:43.980 --> 35:44.690
Well...

718
35:45.050 --> 35:45.820
Team Leader Pan,

719
35:45.820 --> 35:47.470
about Chen Ying,

720
35:47.650 --> 35:48.650
I want to have a brief talk

721
35:48.650 --> 35:49.760
with you.

722
35:49.880 --> 35:51.050
As far as I know,

723
35:51.090 --> 35:52.030
she was fully prepared

724
35:52.030 --> 35:53.620
for her transfer.

725
35:53.940 --> 35:55.690
It's not the kind of nepotism

726
35:55.720 --> 35:57.010
you think it is.

727
35:57.050 --> 35:58.010
And this position...

728
35:58.010 --> 35:58.490
Mr. Qi,

729
35:58.490 --> 35:59.650
we've already

730
35:59.680 --> 36:01.140
reached a conclusion on this.

731
36:01.140 --> 36:03.140
Let's not discuss it further,

732
36:03.170 --> 36:03.850
okay?

733
36:10.220 --> 36:11.660
-Sir, I put it in. -Okay.

734
36:15.450 --> 36:17.200
-What’s wrong? -It's hot. Be careful.

735
36:17.200 --> 36:17.930
Here you go.

736
36:17.930 --> 36:18.650
Thanks.

737
36:19.050 --> 36:20.280
Look at these stalls.

738
36:20.300 --> 36:21.830
Their business is booming.

739
36:23.400 --> 36:26.250
If I really can't find a job,

740
36:26.630 --> 36:27.960
I'll also set up a stall.

741
36:28.360 --> 36:29.170
Ying,

742
36:29.940 --> 36:31.610
no matter what you do,

743
36:31.630 --> 36:32.550
count me in.

744
36:32.760 --> 36:33.890
I'm strong.

745
36:35.650 --> 36:37.430
You're strong?

746
36:37.450 --> 36:38.370
Let's go.

747
36:40.610 --> 36:42.010
Set up a stall.

748
36:45.150 --> 36:46.280
Put this here.

749
36:46.470 --> 36:47.470
Do you want socks?

750
36:48.910 --> 36:52.920
[Socks]

751
36:49.220 --> 36:50.220
Do you want socks?

752
36:50.640 --> 36:51.550
No.

753
36:53.070 --> 36:54.020
Sit down.

754
36:54.260 --> 36:55.050
No need.

755
36:57.240 --> 36:58.050
Ying,

756
36:58.280 --> 37:00.280
it's okay to set up a stall,

757
37:00.690 --> 37:03.310
but do we have to do it at the plant gate?

758
37:03.800 --> 37:05.540
There are so many familiar people.

759
37:05.540 --> 37:08.070
I'm afraid they might say bad words about you.

760
37:08.210 --> 37:09.460
The more familiar the place is,

761
37:09.460 --> 37:09.940
the better you know

762
37:09.940 --> 37:11.670
when there are more customers.

763
37:11.950 --> 37:12.870
Besides,

764
37:13.370 --> 37:14.090
selling socks

765
37:14.090 --> 37:15.620
isn't something shameful.

766
37:17.090 --> 37:18.610
Put this in the front.

767
37:18.630 --> 37:20.740
Ying, you should take a break.

768
37:20.760 --> 37:22.080
I'll go get some food.

769
37:22.310 --> 37:23.400
Take a break.

770
37:27.680 --> 37:31.290
[Socks]

771
37:29.290 --> 37:30.310
Not bad.

772
37:31.080 --> 37:33.680
You're doing business right at the plant gate.

773
37:35.400 --> 37:36.410
Do you want socks?

774
37:37.720 --> 37:38.530
For this kind,

775
37:38.530 --> 37:39.170
1 yuan a pair,

776
37:39.170 --> 37:40.430
1.5 yuan for two pairs.

777
37:41.570 --> 37:43.450
If you had chosen me,

778
37:44.090 --> 37:46.220
you wouldn't have to suffer like this.

779
37:47.620 --> 37:49.100
I make my own living,

780
37:49.580 --> 37:50.850
unlike some people

781
37:51.380 --> 37:52.840
who always cling to others

782
37:53.330 --> 37:54.490
like stinky socks

783
37:54.510 --> 37:55.910
that can't be shaken off.

784
37:58.710 --> 38:00.710
Which socks are the most expensive?

785
38:01.980 --> 38:03.040
Knee-high socks.

786
38:03.250 --> 38:04.530
The black ones,

787
38:04.550 --> 38:06.350
and the ones in the plastic bags.

788
38:08.500 --> 38:09.540
These socks...

789
38:10.880 --> 38:12.270
Is the quality good?

790
38:13.640 --> 38:15.280
Here's a piece of advice.

791
38:15.310 --> 38:17.590
Whether working in a state-owned enterprise

792
38:17.590 --> 38:19.360
or doing a small business,

793
38:19.730 --> 38:21.990
you have to make sure the quality is good.

794
38:24.680 --> 38:26.180
These socks are terrible.

795
38:26.210 --> 38:27.350
They get holes so easily.

796
38:27.350 --> 38:28.440
It's not going to work.

797
38:28.440 --> 38:29.990
People have to pay.

798
38:30.120 --> 38:30.570
Look,

799
38:30.590 --> 38:32.720
who wants to buy torn socks like these?

800
38:34.720 --> 38:35.530
Thank you.

801
38:37.050 --> 38:38.710
Quality is what matters most.

802
38:47.730 --> 38:48.990
Shan! Shan!

803
38:49.350 --> 38:50.600
Shan! Shan!

804
38:50.620 --> 38:51.620
-Shan! -Stop!

805
38:52.470 --> 38:54.390
Ying, he's picking on you again!

806
38:55.980 --> 38:56.820
Shan.

807
38:57.320 --> 38:58.200
I know

808
38:58.460 --> 38:59.720
you want to protect me.

809
39:01.770 --> 39:02.820
But right now,

810
39:03.730 --> 39:05.530
I only hope you can stay safe.

811
39:05.590 --> 39:07.120
Don't cause trouble again.

812
39:10.650 --> 39:12.810
Eat up. The popsicle is melting.

813
39:19.950 --> 39:21.490
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

814
39:24.240 --> 39:25.220
Director Geng,

815
39:25.400 --> 39:26.930
the celebration banquet

816
39:26.930 --> 39:28.200
is ready.

817
39:28.430 --> 39:29.490
After the meeting,

818
39:29.680 --> 39:31.650
we'll go to the private room at Songhe Restaurant.

819
39:31.650 --> 39:32.900
Private Room 2.

820
39:32.650 --> 39:34.970
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

821
39:32.920 --> 39:34.000
Okay.

822
39:34.030 --> 39:34.950
Stop talking.

823
39:42.630 --> 39:44.320
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

824
39:48.210 --> 39:49.090
Hello, everyone.

825
39:49.090 --> 39:50.990
Following deliberation by the factory Party committee

826
39:50.990 --> 39:52.550
and approval by the higher-level Party committee,

827
39:51.590 --> 39:58.610
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

828
39:52.580 --> 39:54.860
I am hereby authorized to announce

829
39:55.260 --> 39:56.690
the appointment of the plant director

830
39:56.690 --> 39:58.620
during the restructuring period.

831
39:59.010 --> 40:00.820
To deepen the reform of state-owned enterprises

832
40:00.820 --> 40:02.820
and optimize the leadership structure,

833
40:02.820 --> 40:04.100
in accordance with the Wugang Petrochemical

834
40:04.100 --> 40:05.120
Gas Distribution Plant

835
40:05.120 --> 40:06.570
Director Work Regulations

836
40:06.570 --> 40:08.430
and the spirit of the opinions on deepening the reform

837
40:08.430 --> 40:09.600
of the personnel system

838
40:09.600 --> 40:10.630
of state-owned enterprises,

839
40:10.630 --> 40:12.330
after research and decision by the CPC Wugang Petrochemical

840
40:12.330 --> 40:14.490
Gas Distribution Plant Party Committee,

841
40:14.490 --> 40:16.720
and with the approval of the superior Party committee,

842
40:14.510 --> 40:18.140
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

843
40:16.880 --> 40:19.280
we're making the following appointments.

844
40:20.200 --> 40:20.970
Comrade Geng Jian...

845
40:20.970 --> 40:22.500
-Great! -Great!

846
40:22.530 --> 40:23.600
-Great! -Great!

847
40:27.890 --> 40:29.030
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

848
40:33.110 --> 40:34.240
Comrade Geng Jian

849
40:34.260 --> 40:36.830
will continue to serve as the deputy director.

850
40:36.830 --> 40:38.370
We're appointing Comrade Qi Mo

851
40:38.370 --> 40:40.540
as the director of the Wugang Petrochemical

852
40:40.540 --> 40:41.450
Gas Distribution Plant,

853
40:41.450 --> 40:43.930
fully in charge of the enterprise's production, operation,

854
40:43.930 --> 40:45.040
technology research and development,

855
40:45.040 --> 40:46.360
market-oriented reform,

856
40:46.360 --> 40:48.140
and internal control management.

857
40:48.140 --> 40:50.290
The term of office starts today,

858
40:50.320 --> 40:51.380
lasting three years.

859
40:51.380 --> 40:52.010
Great!

860
40:54.550 --> 40:57.030
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant Review and Summary Conference]

861
40:56.990 --> 40:58.570
Comrade Qi Mo, your reform plan

862
40:58.570 --> 40:59.570
is excellent.

863
40:59.980 --> 41:00.980
I hope you can

864
41:01.000 --> 41:02.870
act as you said and thought that day,

865
41:02.870 --> 41:04.320
and lead our plant

866
41:04.340 --> 41:05.570
into a new era!

867
41:05.590 --> 41:07.800
-Great! -Great!

868
41:10.510 --> 41:13.740
Now let's invite Director Qi Mo

869
41:13.950 --> 41:16.390
to the stage and say a few words.

870
41:16.420 --> 41:17.110
Okay!

871
41:26.780 --> 41:29.700
This appointment is really a surprise.

872
41:30.240 --> 41:32.840
But now that the leaders

873
41:33.240 --> 41:34.750
have entrusted me with this heavy responsibility,

874
41:34.750 --> 41:37.880
I'll certainly live up to their expectations

875
41:38.340 --> 41:40.540
and lead our plant to embrace the reform

876
41:40.680 --> 41:42.410
and write a brand-new chapter!

877
41:42.570 --> 41:43.700
Thank you, leaders,

878
41:43.880 --> 41:44.930
and thank you all.

879
41:47.010 --> 41:47.880
Five years ago,

880
41:48.280 --> 41:50.480
you said someone in your family was sick

881
41:50.820 --> 41:53.070
and borrowed 20,000 yuan from Finance.

882
41:53.090 --> 41:54.820
You still haven't paid it back.

883
41:55.180 --> 41:56.780
I never mentioned it

884
41:56.130 --> 41:57.240
[IOU]

885
41:57.700 --> 42:00.030
and even helped you cover up the accounts.

886
42:01.840 --> 42:02.840
Three years ago,

887
42:02.930 --> 42:04.660
you were arrested

888
42:04.680 --> 42:06.480
for soliciting at a dance club.

889
42:06.500 --> 42:07.860
I paid and pulled strings

890
42:07.860 --> 42:09.170
to get you out.

891
42:09.490 --> 42:11.710
This is the detention warrant from that time.

892
42:10.620 --> 42:12.170
[Decision on Early Release by the Wugang County Public Security Bureau]

893
42:13.260 --> 42:14.920
I was the one who picked you up.

894
42:15.800 --> 42:17.070
No one else knows.

895
42:17.680 --> 42:18.600
A year ago,

896
42:18.910 --> 42:20.740
you went to the north on a business trip.

897
42:20.740 --> 42:22.580
At the dinner table, you got a little drunk

898
42:22.580 --> 42:24.270
and groped a saleswoman.

899
42:24.290 --> 42:25.770
She came straight to me,

900
42:26.310 --> 42:28.110
threatening to report you for sexual assault.

901
42:28.110 --> 42:29.720
I paid another 20,000 yuan

902
42:29.810 --> 42:31.870
[Receipt]

903
42:30.190 --> 42:31.750
to keep her silent.

904
42:31.780 --> 42:33.710
This is the receipt from that time.

905
42:41.610 --> 42:42.340
Boss.

906
42:44.310 --> 42:45.980
What do you mean?

907
42:47.240 --> 42:48.440
I only want to tell you

908
42:49.310 --> 42:51.840
that you have to help me persuade your senior.

909
42:51.900 --> 42:53.770
As long as she doesn't turn herself in,

910
42:53.770 --> 42:56.250
I'll return all these things to you.

911
42:56.410 --> 42:57.200
Moreover,

912
42:57.500 --> 42:58.930
I'll retire early,

913
42:59.950 --> 43:01.980
and you'll be the plant director.

914
43:09.370 --> 43:10.160
In addition,

915
43:10.940 --> 43:12.170
Comrade Geng Jian

916
43:12.190 --> 43:13.880
has done his best

917
43:14.240 --> 43:16.450
and made great contributions

918
43:16.850 --> 43:18.090
during his time as the acting director.

919
43:18.090 --> 43:20.570
Now, let's welcome Deputy Director Geng Jian

920
43:20.570 --> 43:22.640
to come on stage and say a few words!

921
43:22.660 --> 43:23.220
Okay!

922
43:38.090 --> 43:39.940
I didn't make

923
43:39.970 --> 43:40.820
great contributions

924
43:40.820 --> 43:42.070
as the leader

925
43:43.610 --> 43:45.330
Actually,

926
43:45.870 --> 43:47.110
I also agree

927
43:47.140 --> 43:49.100
that Qi Mo is

928
43:49.840 --> 43:52.350
the most suitable candidate

929
43:52.380 --> 43:53.910
for the director position.

930
43:54.310 --> 43:55.750
He's got solid foundations

931
43:55.750 --> 43:57.200
and understand the technology.

932
43:57.200 --> 43:59.730
-That's how unpredictable life is. -I believe that under

933
43:59.730 --> 44:02.780
-You never know who'll be the next winner. -Director Qi's leadership, our factory

934
44:02.780 --> 44:05.820
will enjoy an even brighter and more prosperous future!

935
44:05.820 --> 44:06.880
Congratulations!

936
44:48.910 --> 44:59.300
[September 3, 1997]
